---
interface Props {
  sourceText: string; // 例: "テレビ番組『サタプラ（ひたすら試してランキング）』で紹介！"
  itemName: string;
  rakutenUrl: string;
  amazonUrl: string;
  price?: string;
  badge?: string;
}

const {
  sourceText,
  itemName,
  rakutenUrl,
  amazonUrl,
  price,
  badge = 'テレビ・話題で急上昇',
} = Astro.props;
---

<div class="my-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 via-orange-500 to-rose-500 p-1 shadow-md">
  <div class="rounded-[14px] bg-white p-5 md:p-6">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-rose-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-rose-700">
        🔥 {badge}
      </span>
      <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
        {sourceText}
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4">
      <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">お探しの商品はこちら（結論）</div>
      <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-snug md:text-2xl">
        {itemName}
      </h3>
      {price && (
        <div class="mt-2 text-base font-bold text-rose-600">
          参考定価: {price}
        </div>
      )}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <a
        href={rakutenUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
        class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#bf0000] px-4 py-3 font-bold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-[#a60000]"
      >
        <span>楽天市場で在庫を見る</span>
        <span>→</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href={amazonUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
        class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#ff9900] px-4 py-3 font-bold text-slate-900 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-[#e68a00]"
      >
        <span>Amazonで在庫を見る</span>
        <span>→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-2.5 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
      ※テレビ放映後は一時的に品薄・転売価格になる場合があります。定価での購入をおすすめします。
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
